      "path": "audio/narrations/rossler-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.32,
      "size": 37152,
      "text": "1976 年，Rössler 写下一组更朴素的方程，同样孕育出混沌。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "rossler-attractor",
